    {
      "id": "sol.amc-8-2004-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Note that \\(1\\) cm represents \\(72 \\div 12 = 6\\) kilometers. This means that \\(17\\) cm represents \\(6 \\cdot 17 = 102\\) kilometers.\n\nThus, B is the correct answer.",
